---
title: The Grateful Dead Shrine
description: Nick's favorite Grateful Dead shows, and why they rule.
---

<p>My favorite shows, the tapes worth hunting down, and soon every Dead-family show I've caught in person.</p>

<h2>Favorite Shows</h2>

{% if dead.favorites.length %}
<ol class="favorite-shows">
{%- for show in dead.favorites %}
  <li{% if show.placeholder %} class="placeholder"{% endif %}>
    <h3><time datetime="{{ show.date }}">{{ show.date | readableDate }}</time></h3>
    <p class="where">{{ show.venue }} &middot; {{ show.city }}</p>
    {%- if show.highlight %}
    <p class="highlight"><strong>Don't miss:</strong> {{ show.highlight }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
    <p>{{ show.why }}</p>
    {%- if show.recording %}
    <p><a href="{{ show.recording }}">Listen to the recording</a></p>
    {%- endif %}
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>
{% else %}
<p>The list is still being argued over.</p>
{% endif %}

